{"id":"af0349c490d72a92","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-absolute-value.md","title":"Absolute Value","display":"df-absolute-value — Absolute Value","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-absolute-value","aliases":["58-df-absolute-value"],"display":"df-absolute-value — Absolute Value","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-field.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-absolute-value"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-absolute-value</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-absolute-value — Absolute Value"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-field.md\">../batch13/58-df-field.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\in V\">\\(K\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+,\\cdot\\subseteq(K\\times K)\\times K\">\\(+,\\cdot\\subseteq(K\\times K)\\times K\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Field}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Field}_S\\)</span> (field-structure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-field.md\">../batch13/58-df-field.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\\subseteq K\\times\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\">\\(v\\subseteq K\\times\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\)</span> (value graph)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AbsVal}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{AbsVal}_S\\)</span> (absolute-value-map predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}absolute\\text{-}value} \\vdash \\operatorname{AbsVal}_S(v,K,+,\\cdot)\\leftrightarrow \\exists 0_K,1_K\\in K\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Field}_S(K,+,\\cdot,0_K,1_K)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(v,K,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})\\land\\forall x\\in K\\;(v(x)=0\\leftrightarrow x=0_K)\\land\\forall x,y\\in K\\;\\bigl(v(x\\cdot y)=v(x)v(y)\\land v(x+y)\\leq v(x)+v(y)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}absolute\\text{-}value} \\vdash \\operatorname{AbsVal}_S(v,K,+,\\cdot)\\leftrightarrow \\exists 0_K,1_K\\in K\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Field}_S(K,+,\\cdot,0_K,1_K)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(v,K,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})\\land\\forall x\\in K\\;(v(x)=0\\leftrightarrow x=0_K)\\land\\forall x,y\\in K\\;\\bigl(v(x\\cdot y)=v(x)v(y)\\land v(x+y)\\leq v(x)+v(y)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>For an ordered field, the usual map is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v(x)=\\max\\{x,-x\\}\">\\(v(x)=\\max\\{x,-x\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-field.md","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-field.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-field.md","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Field}_S$ (field-structure predicate, see [[../batch13/58-df-field.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"K\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"+,\\cdot\\subseteq(K\\times K)\\times K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Field}_S","display":false},{"tex":"v\\subseteq K\\times\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{AbsVal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}absolute\\text{-}value} \\vdash \\operatorname{AbsVal}_S(v,K,+,\\cdot)\\leftrightarrow \\exists 0_K,1_K\\in K\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Field}_S(K,+,\\cdot,0_K,1_K)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(v,K,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})\\land\\forall x\\in K\\;(v(x)=0\\leftrightarrow x=0_K)\\land\\forall x,y\\in K\\;\\bigl(v(x\\cdot y)=v(x)v(y)\\land v(x+y)\\leq v(x)+v(y)\\bigr)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"v(x)=\\max\\{x,-x\\}","display":false}],"bytes":1102,"backlinks":[{"id":"92fa2b66cf33e6eb","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-104","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-absolute-value.md|58-df-absolute-value]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["1eb4a89b005d9cda","36d7463d215be751"]}